From 58463f73e96a47507753d44f796551d81691a7db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Graham <scott.github@h4ck3r.net>
Date: Fri, 20 Feb 2026 10:50:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] Add experimental direct Mach-O emission

With `-f macho`, directly emits a macOS .o rather than .s.

Output .o should always be the same as if .s is assembled by clang as
verified by tools/objtest.sh, but probably isn't always yet!
---
